<title>USA: Portland General Corp Q1 oper shr falls.</title>
<headline>Portland General Corp Q1 oper shr falls.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							     March 31</p>
<p> Summary of Earnings (000's)		    1997	  1996</p>
<p> Operating Revenues			    $368,075    $300,581</p>
<p> Operating Expenses			     264,477     195,528</p>
<p> Income Taxes					39,548	37,049</p>
<p> Net Operating Income			    64,050	68,004</p>
<p> Net Income					  59,377	49,362</p>
<p> Earnings Per Average Share			1.16	  0.97</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding		51,375,172  51,063,105</p>
<p> Dividends Declared Per Share		    0.32	  0.32</p>
<p> Retail Customers (End of Period)	   671,972     654,127</p>
<p> Retail MWh Sales (Thousands)		   4,836	 4,693</p>
<p> Wholesale MWh Sales (Thousands)		6,415	 2,167</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 earnings include non-operating income of $17 million.</p>
<p>Excluding the non-operating income, 1997 quarterly earnings were $42 million or $0.82 per share compared to $49 million or $0.97 per share in first quarter 1996.</p>
</text>
